{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "granthId": "dasam",
  "ang": 218,
  "lineCount": 48,
  "source": "BaniDB",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਹੂੰ ਬੀਨ ਬਾਜੈ ਕੋਊ ਬਾਸੁਰੀ ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ ਸਾਜੈ ਦੇਖੇ ਕਾਮ ਲਾਜੈ ਰਹੇ ਭਿੱਛਕ ਅਘਾਇ ਕੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kahoo(n) been baajai kouoo baasuree miradha(n)g saajai dhekhe kaam laajai rahe bhi'chhak aghai kai ||",
      "translation": "Somewhere the lyre is being played, somewhere flutes, drum and other musical instruments. On seeing all this the god of love is feeling shy and so mush charity was donated that the beggars feel satisfied.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਿਤੇ ਬੀਨ ਵੱਜਦੀ ਹੈ ਕਿਤੇ ਬੰਸਰੀ ਨਾਲ ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ ਸਜ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ। ਕਾਮ ਦੇਖ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਰਮਿੰਦਾ ਹੋ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੰਗਤੇ (ਪਦਾਰਥਾ ਨੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰਕੇ) ਰਸ ਗਏ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कहूँ बीन बाजै कोऊ बासुरी मृदंग साजै देखे काम लाजै रहे भिच्छक अघाइ कै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84371",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੰਕ ਤੇ ਸੁ ਰਾਜਾ ਭਏ ਆਸਿਖ ਅਸੇਖ ਦਏ ਮਾਗਤ ਨ ਭਏ ਫੇਰ ਐਸੋ ਦਾਨ ਪਾਇ ਕੈ ॥੧੭੫॥",
      "transliteration": "ra(n)k te su raajaa bhe aasikh asekh dhe maagat na bhe fer aaiso dhaan pai kai ||175||",
      "translation": "The poor became king-like and began to give blessings  after receiving alms, no tendency for begging was left.175.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੰਗਤੇ ਕੰਗਾਲ ਤੋਂ ਰਾਜੇ ਹੋ ਗਏ ਹਨ। ਬੇਸ਼ੁਮਾਰ ਅਸੀਸਾ ਦਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਅਜਿਹਾ ਦਾਨ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰਕੇ ਫਿਰ ਉਹ ਕਦੇ ਮੰਗਤੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋ ਸਕਣਗੇ ॥੧੭੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रंक ते सु राजा भए आसिख असेख दए मागत न भए फेर ऐसो दान पाइ कै ॥१७५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84372",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਨ ਕੈ ਜਨਕ ਲੀਨੋ ਕੰਠ ਸੋ ਲਗਾਇ ਤਿਹੂੰ ਆਦਰ ਦੁਰੰਤ ਕੈ ਅਨੰਤ ਭਾਤਿ ਲਏ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aan kai janak leeno ka(n)Th so lagai tihoo(n) aadhar dhura(n)t kai ana(n)t bhaat le hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "Janak came and hugged all the three to his bosom and honoured them in various ways.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਿੰਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਜਨਕ ਨੇ ਆ ਕੇ ਗਲ਼ ਨਾਲ ਲਾ ਲਿਆ, ਬੜਾ ਆਦਰ ਕਰਕੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਸੁਆਗਤ ਕੀਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आन कै जनक लीनो कंठ सो लगाइ तिहूँ आदर दुरंत कै अनंत भाति लए हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84373",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬੇਦ ਕੇ ਬਿਧਾਨ ਕੈ ਕੈ ਬਯਾਸ ਤੇ ਬਧਾਈ ਬੇਦ ਏਕ ਏਕ ਬਿਪ੍ਰ ਕਉ ਬਿਸੇਖ ਸ੍ਵਰਨ ਦਏ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bedh ke bidhaan kai kai bayaas te badhaiee bedh ek ek bipr kau bisekh savairan dhe hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "The Vedic discipline was observed and the Brahmins recited the congratulatory Vedic mantras.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵੇਦ ਦੀ ਵਿਧੀ ਨਾਲ ਬਿਆਸ ਤੋਂ ਬੇਦੀ ਬਣਵਾਈ ਅਤੇ ਇਕ ਇਕ ਬ੍ਰਾਹਮਣ ਨੂੰ ਬਹੁਤ-ਬਹੁਤ ਮੋਹਰਾ ਦਿੱਤੀਆਂ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बेद के बिधान कै कै बयास ते बधाई बेद एक एक बिप्र कउ बिसेख स्वरन दए हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84374",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਾਜਕੁਆਰ ਸਭੈ ਪਹਿਰਾਇ ਸਿਰਪਾਇਨ ਤੇ ਮੋਤੀਮਾਨ ਕਰਕੇ ਬਰਖ ਮੇਘ ਗਏ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "raajakuaar sabhai pahirai sirapain te moteemaan karake barakh megh ge hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "The king gave the gift of gold to each Brahmin, the princes were given presents and there was shower of gems.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜ-ਕੁਮਾਰਾ ਨੂੰ ਸਿਰ ਤੋਂ ਪੈਰਾ ਤੱਕ ਸਾਰੇ ਬਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਹਿਨਾਏ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਵੇਲੇ ਮੋਤੀਆਂ ਤੇ ਮਾਣਕਾ ਦਾ ਮੀਂਹ ਵਸ ਪਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "राजकुआर सभै पहिराइ सिरपाइन ते मोतीमान करके बरख मेघ गए हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84375",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੰਤੀ ਸ੍ਵੇਤ ਦੀਨੇ ਕੇਤੇ ਸਿੰਧਲੀ ਤੁਰੇ ਨਵੀਨੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਕੇ ਕੁਮਾਰ ਤੀਨੋ ਬਯਾਹ ਕੈ ਪਠਏ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੭੬॥",
      "transliteration": "dha(n)tee savaiet dheene kete si(n)dhalee ture naveene raajaa ke kumaar teeno bayaeh kai paThe hai(n) ||176||",
      "translation": "The white elephants and the brisk horses of Sindhu were presented to the princes, in this way all the three princes moved black after their wedding.176.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਿੰਨੇ ਹੀ ਚਿੱਟੇ ਹਾਥੀ (ਦਾਨ) ਦਿੱਤੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਿੰਧ ਦੇਸ਼ ਦੇ ਕਿੰਨੇ ਹੀ ਨਵੇਾਂ ਘੋੜੇ (ਦਾਨ) ਦਿੱਤੇ । ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਰਾਜ-ਕੁਮਾਰਾ ਨੂੰ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ ਭੇਜਿਆ ਗਿਆ ॥੧੭੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दंती स्वेत दीने केते सिंधली तुरे नवीने राजा के कुमार तीनो बयाह कै पठए हैं ॥१७६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84376",
      "sourceShabadId": "7927",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੋਧਕ ਛੰਦ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhodhak chha(n)dh ||",
      "translation": "DODHAK STANZA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੋਧਕ ਛੰਦ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दोधक छंद ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84377",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਯਾਹ ਸੁਤਾ ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਕੀ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਬਾਲੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "biyaeh sutaa nirap kee nirapabaala(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜ-ਕੁਮਾਰਾ ਨੇ ਰਾਜ-ਕੁਮਾਰੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बियाह सुता नृप की नृपबालं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84378",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮਾਗ ਬਿਦਾ ਮੁਖਿ ਲੀਨ ਉਤਾਲੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "maag bidhaa mukh leen utaala(n) ||",
      "translation": "After marrying the daughter of King Janak, the princes soon asked for permission to depart.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੂੰਹ ਨਾਲ ਛੇਤੀ ਹੀ ਵਿਦਾਇਗੀ ਮੰਗ ਲਈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "माग बिदा मुखि लीन उतालं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84379",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਾਜਨ ਬਾਜ ਚਲੇ ਗਜ ਸੰਜੁਤ ॥",
      "transliteration": "saajan baaj chale gaj sa(n)jut ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਸਮੇਤ ਘੋੜਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਸਜਾ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "साजन बाज चले गज संजुत ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84380",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਏਸਨਏਸ ਨਰੇਸਨ ਕੇ ਜੁਤ ॥੧੭੭॥",
      "transliteration": "esanes naresan ke jut ||177||",
      "translation": "This group of kings accompanied by elephants and horses, having many desires in their mind, started (for back journey).177.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਹਾਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਤੇ ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਸਣੇ ਤੁਰ ਪਏ ॥੧੭੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "एसनएस नरेसन के जुत ॥१७७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84381",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਾਜ ਸੁਮਾਰ ਸਕੈ ਕਰ ਕਉਨੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhaaj sumaar sakai kar kaunai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਰਾਜੇ ਜਨਕ ਨੇ ਜੋ) ਦਾਜ ਦਿੱਤਾ, ਉਸ ਦੀ ਗਿਣਤੀ (ਸੁਮਾਰ) ਕੋਣ ਕਰ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ?",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दाज सुमार सकै कर कउनै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84382",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬੀਨ ਸਕੈ ਬਿਧਨਾ ਨਹੀ ਤਉਨੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "been sakai bidhanaa nahee taunai ||",
      "translation": "The dowry was given in such a great measure that even the Brahmins could not keep the same collectively.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਵੀ ਚੁਣ ਕੇ (ਇਕੱਤਰ) ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बीन सकै बिधना नही तउनै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84383",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬੇਸਨ ਬੇਸਨ ਬਾਜ ਮਹਾ ਮਤ ॥",
      "transliteration": "besan besan baaj mahaa mat ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰੰਗਾ ਰੰਗ ਦੇ ਵੱਡੇ ਮਸਤ ਘੋੜੇ ਸਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बेसन बेसन बाज महा मत ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84384",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੇਸਨ ਭੇਸ ਚਲੇ ਗਜ ਗੱਜਤ ॥੧੭੮॥",
      "transliteration": "bhesan bhes chale gaj ga'jat ||178||",
      "translation": "Many types of horses and the thundering elephants in many garbs started moving.178.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ-ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਹਾਥੀ ਚਿੰਘਾੜਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਚਲ ਰਹੇ ਸਨ ॥੧੭੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भेसन भेस चले गज गज्जत ॥१७८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84385",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਾਜਤ ਨਾਦ ਨਫੀਰਨ ਕੇ ਗਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "baajat naadh nafeeran ke gan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸੰਖ ਤੇ ਨਫ਼ੀਰੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਸਮੂਹ ਵੱਜਦੇ ਸਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बाजत नाद नफीरन के गन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84386",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਾਜਤ ਸੂਰ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥ ਮਹਾ ਮਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "gaajat soor pramaath mahaa man ||",
      "translation": "The sound of fifes resounded and the mighty warriors thundered.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਹਾਨ ਕਠੋਰ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਗੱਜਦੇ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गाजत सूर प्रमाथ महा मन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84387",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਉਧ ਪੁਰੀ ਨੀਅਰਾਨ ਰਹੀ ਜਬ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aaudh puree neearaan rahee jab ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਦੋਂ ਬਰਾਤ ਅਯੁੱਧਿਆ ਦੇ ਨੇੜੇ ਆ ਗਈ ਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अउध पुरी नीअरान रही जब ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84388",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਭਏ ਰਘੁਨੰਦ ਤਹੀ ਤਬ ॥੧੭੯॥",
      "transliteration": "praapat bhe raghuna(n)dh tahee tab ||179||",
      "translation": "When Oudhpuri was nearby, then all were welcomed by Ram.179.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਮ ਚੰਦਰ (ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ) ਸੁਆਗਤ ਲਈ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਗਏ ॥੧੭੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "प्रापत भए रघुनंद तही तब ॥१७९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84389",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮਾਤਨ ਵਾਰਿ ਪੀਯੋ ਜਲ ਪਾਨੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "maatan vaar peeyo jal paana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਾਤਾਵਾ ਨੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਹੱਥਾ ਨਾਲ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਦੇ ਸਿਰ ਤੋਂ ਪਾਣੀ ਵਾਰ ਕੇ ਪੀਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मातन वारि पीयो जल पानं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84390",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੇਖ ਨਰੇਸ ਰਹੇ ਛਬਿ ਮਾਨੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhekh nares rahe chhab maana(n) ||",
      "translation": "The mother drank water after its propitiatory offering to princes and the King Dasrath was highly pleased in his mind seeing this splendour.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜਾ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਅਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੋ ਗਏ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "देख नरेस रहे छबि मानं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84391",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੂਪ ਬਿਲੋਕਤ ਲਾਇ ਲਏ ਉਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhoop bilokat lai le ur ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜੇ ਦਸ਼ਰਥ ਨੇ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਗਲ਼ ਨਾਲ ਲਾ ਲਿਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भूप बिलोकत लाइ लए उर ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84392",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਚਤ ਗਾਵਤ ਗੀਤ ਭਏ ਪੁਰਿ ॥੧੮੦॥",
      "transliteration": "naachat gaavat geet bhe pur ||180||",
      "translation": "On seeing the princes, the king hugged them to his bosom and all the people entered the city while dancing and singing.180.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਪੁਰ (ਵਾਸੀ) ਨੱਚਣ ਅਤੇ ਗੀਤ ਗਾਉਣ ਲੱਗੇ ॥੧੮੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाचत गावत गीत भए पुरि ॥१८०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84393",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੂਪਜ ਬਯਾਹ ਜਬੈ ਗ੍ਰਹ ਆਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhoopaj bayaeh jabai greh aae ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜ-ਕੁਮਾਰ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ ਜਦੋਂ ਘਰ ਆਏ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भूपज बयाह जबै ग्रह आए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84394",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਾਜਤ ਭਾਤਿ ਅਨੇਕ ਬਧਾਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "baajat bhaat anek badhaae ||",
      "translation": "When the princes came home after their marriage, then many kinds of congratulatory songs were sung.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਾ ਅਨੇਕ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਸਾਦੀਆਨੇ ਵੱਜਣ ਲੱਗੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बाजत भाति अनेक बधाए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84395",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾਤ ਬਸਿਸਟ ਸੁਮਿਤ੍ਰ ਬੁਲਾਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taat basisaT sumitr bulaae ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਿਤਾ ਨੇ ਵਸ਼ਿਸ਼ਟ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਸ਼ਵਾਮਿਤਰ ਨੂੰ ਬੁਲਾਇਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तात बसिसट सुमित्र बुलाए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84396",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਉਰ ਅਨੇਕ ਤਹਾ ਰਿਖਿ ਆਏ ॥੧੮੧॥",
      "transliteration": "aaur anek tahaa rikh aae ||181||",
      "translation": "Dasrath called Vasishtha and Sumantra and with them came several other sages.181.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਹੋਰ ਵੀ ਅਨੇਕਾ ਰਿਸ਼ੀ ਉਥੇ ਆ ਗਏ ॥੧੮੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अउर अनेक तहा रिखि आए ॥१८१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84397",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਘੋਰ ਉਠੀ ਘਹਰਾਇ ਘਟਾ ਤਬ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ghor uThee ghaharai ghaTaa tab ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਦੋਂ ਭਿਆਨਕ ਘਟਾ ਚੜ੍ਰਹ ਕੇ ਗਰਜਣ ਲੱਗੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "घोर उठी घहराइ घटा तब ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84398",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚਾਰੋ ਦਿਸ ਦਿਗ ਦਾਹ ਲਖਿਯੋ ਸਭ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chaaro dhis dhig dhaeh lakhiyo sabh ||",
      "translation": "At that time the clouds gathered on all the four sides and all saw apparently the flames of fire in all the four directions.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਚੋਹਾ ਪਾਸੇ ਭਿਆਨਕ ਅੱਗ ਲੱਗੀ ਹੋਈ ਸਭ ਨੇ ਵੇਖੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चारो दिस दिग दाह लखियो सभ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84399",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੰਤ੍ਰੀ ਮਿਤ੍ਰ ਸਭੈ ਅਕੁਲਾਨੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ma(n)tree mitr sabhai akulaane ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਾਰੇ ਮੰਤਰੀ ਅਤੇ ਮਿੱਤਰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਘਬਰਾ ਗਏ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मंत्री मित्र सभै अकुलाने ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84400",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੂਪਤਿ ਸੋ ਇਹ ਭਾਤ ਬਖਾਨੇ ॥੧੮੨॥",
      "transliteration": "bhoopat so ieh bhaat bakhaane ||182||",
      "translation": "On seeing this all the ministers and friends became worried and request the king in the following manner.182.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਦਸ਼ਰਥ ਨੂੰ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਕਹਿਣ ਲੱਗੇ ॥੧੮੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भूपति सो इह भात बखाने ॥१८२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84401",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋਤ ਉਤਪਾਤ ਬਡੇ ਸੁਣ ਰਾਜਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "hot utapaat badde sun raajan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਸੁਣੋ, ਵੱਡੇ-ਵੱਡੇ ਉਪਦ੍ਰਵ ਹੋ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "होत उतपात बडे सुण राजन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84402",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਕਰੋ ਰਿਖ ਜੋਰ ਸਮਾਜਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ma(n)tr karo rikh jor samaajan ||",
      "translation": "“O King! There are many cases of providential wrath, tumult on all the four sides, therefore give thought to them by calling all the sages and advisers.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਿਸ਼ੀ-ਸਮਾਜ ਨੂੰ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਇਸ ਗੱਲ ਦਾ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मंत्र करो रिख जोर समाजन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84403",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬੋਲਹੁ ਬਿੱਪ ਬਿਲੰਬ ਨ ਕੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bolahu bi'p bila(n)b na keejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੇਰ ਨਾ ਕਰੋ ਅਤੇ ਬ੍ਰਾਹਮਣਾ ਨੂੰ ਸੱਦ ਲਵੋ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बोलहु बिप्प बिलंब न कीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84404",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੈ ਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਜੱਗ ਅਰੰਭਨ ਕੀਜੈ ॥੧੮੩॥",
      "transliteration": "hai kirat ja'g ara(n)bhan keejai ||183||",
      "translation": "“Call the Brahmins without delay and begin Krit Yajna.183.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਸ਼੍ਵਮੇਧ ਯੱਗ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰ ਦਿਓ ॥੧੮੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "है कृत जग्ग अरंभन कीजै ॥१८३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84405",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਇਸ ਰਾਜ ਦਯੋ ਤਤਕਾਲਹ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aais raaj dhayo tatakaaleh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜੇ ਨੇ ਤੁਰੰਤ ਹੁਕਮ ਦਿੱਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आइस राज दयो ततकालह ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84406",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਸੁ ਮਿੱਤ੍ਰਹ ਬੁੱਧ ਬਿਸਾਲਹ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ma(n)tr su mi'treh bu'dh bisaaleh ||",
      "translation": "“O King! give instant orders for starting the Krit Yajna without delay,",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵਿਸ਼ਾਲ ਬੁੱਧੀ ਵਾਲੇ ਮੰਤਰੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਮਿੱਤਰਾ (ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ)-",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मंत्र सु मित्त्रह बुद्ध बिसालह ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84407",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੈ ਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਜੱਗ ਅਰੰਭਨ ਕੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "hai kirat ja'g ara(n)bhan keejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਸ਼੍ਵਮੇਧ ਯੱਗ ਛੇਤੀ ਆਰੰਭ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਏ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "है कृत जग्ग अरंभन कीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84408",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਇਸ ਬੇਗ ਨਰੇਸ ਕਰੀਜੈ ॥੧੮੪॥",
      "transliteration": "aais beg nares kareejai ||184||",
      "translation": "“In view of the great wisdom of friends and ministers.”184.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਲਈ) ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਜਲਦੀ ਆਗਿਆ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਏ ॥੧੮੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आइस बेग नरेस करीजै ॥१८४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84409",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬੋਲਿ ਬਡੇ ਰਿਖ ਲੀਨ ਮਹਾ ਦਿਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bol badde rikh leen mahaa dhij ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵੱਡੇ ਰਿਸ਼ੀ ਤੇ ਮਹਾ ਪੰਡਿਤ ਸੱਦ ਲਏ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बोलि बडे रिख लीन महा दिज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84410",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੈ ਤਿਨ ਬੋਲ ਲਯੋ ਜੁਤ ਰਿਤਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "hai tin bol layo jut ritaj ||",
      "translation": "The king called he eminent sages and great friends soon.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੇ) ਘੋੜੇ ਸਮੇਤ ਰਿਤਜ (ਯੱਗ ਕਰਾਉਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਪੰਡਿਤ ਬੁਲਾ ਲਏ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "है तिन बोल लयो जुत रितज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84411",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪਾਵਕ ਕੁੰਡ ਖੁਦਿਯੋ ਤਿਹ ਅਉਸਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "paavak ku(n)dd khudhiyo teh aausar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਗਨਿ ਕੁੰਡ ਉਸੇ ਵੇਲੇ ਪੁੱਟਿਆ ਗਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पावक कुँड खुदियो तिह अउसर ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84412",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਾਡਿਯ ਖੰਭ ਤਹਾ ਧਰਮੰ ਧਰ ॥੧੮੫॥",
      "transliteration": "gaaddiy kha(n)bh tahaa dharama(n) dhar ||185||",
      "translation": "The sacrificial pit was dug up there and a pillar of righteousness was established.185.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਥੇ ਹੀ ਧਰਤੀ ਵਿੱਚ 'ਧਰਮ ਖੰਭਾ' ਗੱਡ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਗਿਆ ॥੧੮੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गाडिय खंभ तहा धरमं धर ॥१८५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84413",
