      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਛੋਰਿ ਲਯੋ ਹਯਸਾਰਹ ਤੇ ਹਯ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chhor layo hayasaareh te hay ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਘੋੜ-ਸ਼ਾਲਾ (ਹਯ-ਸਾਰ) ਤੋਂ ਘੋੜਾ ਖੋਲ ਲਿਆ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "छोरि लयो हयसारह ते हय ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84414",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਸਿਤ ਕਰਨ ਪ੍ਰਭਾਸਤ ਕੇਕਯ ॥",
      "transliteration": "asit karan prabhaasat kekay ||",
      "translation": "A horse was let off from the stable so that ending the glory of other king they may be conquered.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਕਾਲੇ ਕੰਨ ਸਨ ਅਤੇ ਸਰੀਰ ਦੀ ਆਭਾ ਨੀਲੀ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "असित करन प्रभासत केकय ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84415",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੇਸਨ ਦੇਸ ਨਰੇਸ ਦਏ ਸੰਗਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhesan dhes nares dhe sa(n)g ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੇਸ਼ਾ ਦੇਸ਼ਾ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ (ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਨਾਲ ਕਰ ਦਿੱਤੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "देसन देस नरेस दए संगि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84416",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0218_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸੂਰ ਸੁਰੰਗ ਸੁਭੈ ਅੰਗ ॥੧੮੬॥",
      "transliteration": "su(n)dhar soor sura(n)g subhai a(n)g ||186||",
      "translation": "The kings several countries were sent alongwith the horse and all of them were persons of beauteous limbs and the enhancer of glory.186.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਹੜੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਸਨ ਅਤੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਅੰਗਾ ਨਾਲ ਸ਼ੋਭਦੇ ਸਨ ॥੧੮੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 218,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुँदर सूर सुरंग सुभै अंग ॥१८६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "84417",
      "sourceShabadId": "7928",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
